    {
      "id": "coriolanus/sceneIV_6.2/p@150845",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "SICINIUS.\nO blessed heavens!",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneIV_6.2/p@150845/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 9,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneIV_6.2/p@150845/line-2",
          "start": 10,
          "end": 28,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 970557,
        "end": 970615,
        "line": 36886,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap06/p@150845",
        "anchor": "sceneIV_6.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "SICINIUS.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus/sceneIV_6.2/p@150907",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "VOLUMNIA.\nMore noble blows than ever thou wise words,\nAnd for Rome’s good. I’ll tell thee what—yet go.\nNay, but thou shalt stay too. I would my son\nWere in Arabia and thy tribe before him,\nHis good sword in his hand.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneIV_6.2/p@150907/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 9,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneIV_6.2/p@150907/line-2",
          "start": 10,
          "end": 53,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneIV_6.2/p@150907/line-3",
          "start": 54,
          "end": 102,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneIV_6.2/p@150907/line-4",
          "start": 103,
          "end": 147,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneIV_6.2/p@150907/line-5",
          "start": 148,
          "end": 188,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneIV_6.2/p@150907/line-6",
          "start": 189,
          "end": 216,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 970619,
        "end": 970885,
        "line": 36891,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap06/p@150907",
        "anchor": "sceneIV_6.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "VOLUMNIA.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus/sceneIV_6.2/p@151177",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "SICINIUS.\nWhat then?",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneIV_6.2/p@151177/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 9,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneIV_6.2/p@151177/line-2",
          "start": 10,
          "end": 20,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 970889,
        "end": 970939,
        "line": 36900,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap06/p@151177",
        "anchor": "sceneIV_6.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "SICINIUS.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus/sceneIV_6.2/p@151231",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "VIRGILIA.\nWhat then?\nHe’d make an end of thy posterity.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneIV_6.2/p@151231/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 9,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneIV_6.2/p@151231/line-2",
          "start": 10,
          "end": 20,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneIV_6.2/p@151231/line-3",
          "start": 21,
          "end": 55,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 970943,
        "end": 971033,
        "line": 36905,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap06/p@151231",
        "anchor": "sceneIV_6.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "VIRGILIA.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus/sceneIV_6.2/p@151325",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "VOLUMNIA.\nBastards and all.\nGood man, the wounds that he does bear for Rome!",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneIV_6.2/p@151325/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 9,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneIV_6.2/p@151325/line-2",
          "start": 10,
          "end": 27,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneIV_6.2/p@151325/line-3",
          "start": 28,
          "end": 76,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 971037,
        "end": 971148,
        "line": 36911,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap06/p@151325",
        "anchor": "sceneIV_6.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "VOLUMNIA.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus/sceneIV_6.2/p@151440",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "MENENIUS.\nCome, come, peace.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneIV_6.2/p@151440/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 9,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneIV_6.2/p@151440/line-2",
          "start": 10,
          "end": 28,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 971152,
        "end": 971210,
        "line": 36917,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap06/p@151440",
        "anchor": "sceneIV_6.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "MENENIUS.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus/sceneIV_6.2/p@151502",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "SICINIUS.\nI would he had continued to his country\nAs he began, and not unknit himself\nThe noble knot he made.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneIV_6.2/p@151502/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 9,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneIV_6.2/p@151502/line-2",
          "start": 10,
          "end": 49,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneIV_6.2/p@151502/line-3",
          "start": 50,
          "end": 85,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneIV_6.2/p@151502/line-4",
          "start": 86,
          "end": 109,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 971214,
        "end": 971363,
        "line": 36922,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap06/p@151502",
        "anchor": "sceneIV_6.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "SICINIUS.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus/sceneIV_6.2/p@151655",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "BRUTUS.\nI would he had.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneIV_6.2/p@151655/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 7,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneIV_6.2/p@151655/line-2",
          "start": 8,
          "end": 23,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 971367,
        "end": 971420,
        "line": 36929,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap06/p@151655",
        "anchor": "sceneIV_6.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "BRUTUS.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus/sceneIV_6.2/p@151712",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "VOLUMNIA.\n“I would he had?” ’Twas you incensed the rabble.\nCats, that can judge as fitly of his worth\nAs I can of those mysteries which heaven\nWill not have Earth to know.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneIV_6.2/p@151712/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 9,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneIV_6.2/p@151712/line-2",
          "start": 10,
          "end": 58,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneIV_6.2/p@151712/line-3",
          "start": 59,
          "end": 101,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneIV_6.2/p@151712/line-4",
          "start": 102,
          "end": 142,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneIV_6.2/p@151712/line-5",
          "start": 143,
          "end": 171,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 971424,
        "end": 971640,
        "line": 36934,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap06/p@151712",
        "anchor": "sceneIV_6.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "VOLUMNIA.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus/sceneIV_6.2/p@151932",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "BRUTUS.\nPray, let’s go.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneIV_6.2/p@151932/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 7,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneIV_6.2/p@151932/line-2",
          "start": 8,
          "end": 23,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 971644,
        "end": 971697,
        "line": 36942,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap06/p@151932",
        "anchor": "sceneIV_6.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "BRUTUS.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus/sceneIV_6.2/p@151989",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "VOLUMNIA.\nNow, pray, sir, get you gone.\nYou have done a brave deed. Ere you go, hear this:\nAs far as doth the Capitol exceed\nThe meanest house in Rome, so far my son—\nThis lady’s husband here, this, do you see?—\nWhom you have banished, does exceed you all.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneIV_6.2/p@151989/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 9,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneIV_6.2/p@151989/line-2",
          "start": 10,
          "end": 39,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneIV_6.2/p@151989/line-3",
          "start": 40,
          "end": 90,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneIV_6.2/p@151989/line-4",
          "start": 91,
          "end": 124,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneIV_6.2/p@151989/line-5",
          "start": 125,
          "end": 166,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneIV_6.2/p@151989/line-6",
          "start": 167,
          "end": 211,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneIV_6.2/p@151989/line-7",
          "start": 212,
          "end": 256,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 971701,
        "end": 972012,
        "line": 36947,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap06/p@151989",
        "anchor": "sceneIV_6.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "VOLUMNIA.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus/sceneIV_6.2/p@152304",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "BRUTUS.\nWell, well, we’ll leave you.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneIV_6.2/p@152304/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 7,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneIV_6.2/p@152304/line-2",
          "start": 8,
          "end": 36,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 972016,
        "end": 972082,
        "line": 36957,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap06/p@152304",
        "anchor": "sceneIV_6.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "BRUTUS.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus/sceneIV_6.2/p@152374",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "SICINIUS.\nWhy stay we to be baited\nWith one that wants her wits?",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneIV_6.2/p@152374/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 9,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneIV_6.2/p@152374/line-2",
          "start": 10,
          "end": 34,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneIV_6.2/p@152374/line-3",
          "start": 35,
          "end": 64,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 972086,
        "end": 972185,
        "line": 36962,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap06/p@152374",
        "anchor": "sceneIV_6.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "SICINIUS.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus/sceneIV_6.2/p@152477",
      "type": "passage",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "right"
      ],
      "text": "[Exeunt Tribunes.]",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [
        {
          "tag": "span",
          "start": 8,
          "end": 16,
          "className": "charname"
        },
        {
          "tag": "i",
          "start": 1,
          "end": 17
        }
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneIV_6.2/p@152477/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 18,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 972189,
        "end": 972265,
        "line": 36968,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap06/p@152477",
        "anchor": "sceneIV_6.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": null,
      "attribution": {
        "status": "source-unlabelled"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus/sceneIV_6.2/p@152557",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "VOLUMNIA.\nTake my prayers with you.\nI would the gods had nothing else to do\nBut to confirm my curses. Could I meet ’em\nBut once a day, it would unclog my heart\nOf what lies heavy to’t.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneIV_6.2/p@152557/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 9,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneIV_6.2/p@152557/line-2",
          "start": 10,
          "end": 35,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneIV_6.2/p@152557/line-3",
          "start": 36,
          "end": 75,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneIV_6.2/p@152557/line-4",
          "start": 76,
          "end": 118,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneIV_6.2/p@152557/line-5",
          "start": 119,
          "end": 159,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneIV_6.2/p@152557/line-6",
          "start": 160,
          "end": 184,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 972269,
        "end": 972503,
        "line": 36970,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap06/p@152557",
        "anchor": "sceneIV_6.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "VOLUMNIA.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus/sceneIV_6.2/p@152795",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "MENENIUS.\nYou have told them home,\nAnd, by my troth, you have cause. You’ll sup with me?",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneIV_6.2/p@152795/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 9,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneIV_6.2/p@152795/line-2",
          "start": 10,
          "end": 34,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneIV_6.2/p@152795/line-3",
          "start": 35,
          "end": 88,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 972507,
        "end": 972630,
        "line": 36979,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap06/p@152795",
        "anchor": "sceneIV_6.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "MENENIUS.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus/sceneIV_6.2/p@152922",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "VOLUMNIA.\nAnger’s my meat. I sup upon myself\nAnd so shall starve with feeding. Come, let’s go.\nLeave this faint puling, and lament as I do,\nIn anger, Juno-like. Come, come, come.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneIV_6.2/p@152922/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 9,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneIV_6.2/p@152922/line-2",
          "start": 10,
          "end": 44,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneIV_6.2/p@152922/line-3",
          "start": 45,
          "end": 94,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneIV_6.2/p@152922/line-4",
          "start": 95,
          "end": 139,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
